627 role
1.	627 (ADMIN)
•	Manage users
•	Assign tasks and schedules to everyone; monitor all tasks ; review uploaded evidence; NO approval need of all tasks.
•	Access reports, exports and the activity log.
•	New feature sa admin pwede nya utusan lahat ng top coor lahat ng clusters na no need na isaisahan (bulk tasks)
•	May option din to assign one cluster lang

HQ role 
2.	HQ
•	Same forms lang ng current Task management (teamacosta2028) 
•	Pwede maka give ng order to Cluster head, Top Coor, and registry officer
•	Naka tagged lang mga names kung sino2 ang nag bigay ng task

Cluster Head role 
3.	Cluster Head
•	Same forms lang ng current Task management (teamacosta2028) 
•	Pwede maka give ng order to Top Coor, and registry officer
•	Naka tagged lang mga names kung sino2 ang nag bigay ng task

Top coor role
4.	Top Coor
•	Same forms lang ng current Task management (teamacosta2028) 
•	Pwede maka give ng order to registry officer
•	Naka tagged lang mga names kung sino2 ang nag bigay ng task

Registry officer role
5.	Registry Officer
•	 View only their own assigned tasks, instructions and schedule.
•	 Submit completion remarks and upload photos.
•	Reporting ay mababato lang dun kung sino ang nagbigay ng task 

Note: Lahat ng task walang approval na kailangan natrace lang kung sino ang nag bigay ng task. 
